sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Redis as Redis Stream
    participant Worker as ActivityBroadcastWorker
    participant Service
    participant Repo
    participant DB
    participant SocketServer as Socket.IO Server
    actor Client

    Redis-->>Worker: XREADGROUP activity-broadcast-stream
    Worker->>Service: ActivityUpsertBroadcast(trip_id, date)
    Service->>Repo: GetActivities(trip_id, date)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT activities
    DB-->>Repo: activities
    Service-->>Worker: activities payload
    Worker->>SocketServer: BroadcastToRoom(activity:broadcast)
    SocketServer-->>Client: activity:broadcast payload
